{'symbol': 'WYNN', 'date': '2022-05-03 12:00:00', 'title': 'WYNN LAS VEGAS UNVEILS NEW LUXURY ACCOMMODATIONS', 'text': "NEW LOOK WILL TRANSFORM MORE THAN 2,600 GUEST ROOMS TODD-AVERY LENAHAN LEADS THE RESORT'S LARGEST AND MOST EXTENSIVE DESIGN EVOLUTION LAS VEGAS , MAY 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WYNN LAS VEGAS (NASDAQ: WYNN), THE LARGEST FORBES TRAVEL GUIDE FIVE-STAR RESORT IN THE WORLD, UNVEILS DETAILS OF A NEW ROOM CONCEPT THAT WILL TRANSFORM ITS LUXURY GUEST ACCOMMODATIONS ACROSS WYNN LAS VEGAS AND WYNN TOWER SUITES. CURRENTLY UNDER CONSTRUCTION AND SCHEDULED TO BE COMPLETED BY JUNE 2022, THE PROJECT IS THE LARGEST AND MOST EXTENSIVE DESIGN EVOLUTION EVER MADE TO THE TOWER'S 2,674 GUEST ROOMS, SUITES, ELEVATOR LOBBIES, AND RESORT TOWER CORRIDORS."}